id": "139226984171335", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139310_1430146043686127_4831240507466186752_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N4TIbJ8BdtsQ7kNvwGCgYV0&_nc_oc=AdniP6Fq2OR6k9j4_rZ_gr4i_3u2VCR12qXTItSHpQAArSbcSNrTqFh5jK8Ot9kv7qk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwVxsnPWPNcvp_pfDxMdq2roqIAOfmpCPVSKa0RNshuLg&oe=69B01338"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "AccuWeather - Weather for Life", "keywords": ["weather", "accuweather", "travel", "forecast", "video"], "long_description": "Get ready for a game-changing virtual experience where AccuWeather, the largest, most accurate source of forecasts and weather warnings in the world, takes you to new heights!\n\nWith AccuWeather- Weather for Life, you can view engaging 360 video content, current weather conditions, a daily and hourly forecast, and AccuWeather MinuteCast\u00ae, the leading minute-by-minute precipitation forecast, hyper-localized to your exact location.\n\nImmerse yourself in an array of weather animations like stormy rain, snow, thunderstorms, and clouds, all which can be accessed either through a secret weather feature called WeatherScape, or experienced during one of your daily forecasts. ", "short_description": "Get ready for a game-changing virtual experience where AccuWeather, the largest, most accurate source of forecasts and weather warnings in the world, takes you to new heights!\n\nWith AccuWeather- Weather for Life, you can view engaging 360 video content, current weather conditions, a daily and hourly forecast, and AccuWeather MinuteCast\u00ae, the leading minute-by-minute precipitation forecast, hyper-localized to your exact location.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.accuweather.com/en/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.accuweather.com/en/legal", "publisher_name": "AccuWeather Intl., Inc", "support_website_url": null, "w